    (property "Pins" "SOT-23 bipolar order is B-E-C, hence the BEC symbol. 40 V: it never sees more than the ~13 V between the pass base and the output" (id 5) (at 810.0 382.0 0)
      (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)
    )
    (property "Note" "Current limit. Conducts when the drop across the 56 ohm reaches one Vbe -- 0.65 V / 56 = 11.6 mA -- and steals the pass transistor's base drive. Without it a shorted 12V_GATE gets hFE x the full bias current from a 100 V rail." (id 6) (at 810.0 382.0 0)
