      (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)
    )
    (property "Note" "Low side back into the boost reservoir. NOT a Zener active clamp across the FET (Nexperia AN50003 rates repetitive active clamp reliability-'Questionable', gate-oxide wear-out) and NOT a freewheel to battery (too slow -- the same problem the boost rail exists to fix on the opening side)." (id 8) (at 146.54 156.0 0)
      (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)
